Fixes included this round: 3341425 SetRules/overlay setters rebuild Config from MergeOverlayOnRaw and sync unsaved Global field edits into scopeRaw; doctor and scope save refresh the preview document. 35170ca stops rebuilding model text inputs on the first overlay keystroke so the cursor stays put.

